From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: abcvicelli <147180743+abcvicelli@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:55:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Do not pass auth token to vold unlockCeStorage

The S926B vold rejects a non-empty token in unlockCeStorage, so devices
with first_api_level <= 30 never unlock CE storage.

---
diff --git a/smali/com/android/server/locksettings/LockSettingsService.smali b/smali/com/android/server/locksettings/LockSettingsService.smali
index aa91ea1..16aaace 100644
--- a/smali/com/android/server/locksettings/LockSettingsService.smali
+++ b/smali/com/android/server/locksettings/LockSettingsService.smali
@@ -22432,7 +22432,7 @@
 
     iget v5, p0, Lcom/android/server/locksettings/LockSettingsService;->mFirstApiLevel:I
 
-    const/16 v6, 0x1e
+    const/16 v6, 0x0
 
     if-gt v5, v6, :cond_8
 
